---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Best Restaurants in Burgas | Where to Eat During Eurovision 2027" 
  description="Discover the best restaurants in Burgas for Eurovision 2027. From fresh Black Sea seafood and traditional Bulgarian mehanas to upscale dining."
  breadcrumb="Restaurants"
>
  <div class="container page-content">
    <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <h1 class="text-gradient" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">Where to Eat in Burgas: The Eurovision Dining Guide</h1>
      
      <p class="lead" style="font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 40px; color: var(--text-muted);">
        Burgas offers a fantastic culinary scene that blends Balkan traditions, Mediterranean influences, and incredible Black Sea seafood. During Eurovision, the best spots will be fully booked weeks in advance.
      </p>

      <div class="glass-panel mb-4">
        <h2>Seafood & Sea Views (Sea Garden / Port Area)</h2>
        <p>You cannot visit Burgas without trying the local Black Sea mussels, fried tsatsa (sprat), and fresh turbot.</p>
        <ul style="margin-top: 16px;">
          <li><strong>Dalyana:</strong> A legendary spot for unpretentious, incredibly fresh fish right by the water.</li>
          <li><strong>Neptun:</strong> An iconic building in the Sea Garden. Upscale Mediterranean and seafood with panoramic sea views.</li>
          <li><strong>Flora Bar & Grill:</strong> Great ambiance, modern European menu, located centrally in the Sea Garden.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="glass-panel mb-4">
        <h2>Traditional Bulgarian (Mehanas)</h2>
        <p>Experience local hospitality, shopska salad, grilled meats, and rakia in a traditional tavern setting.</p>
        <ul style="margin-top: 16px;">
          <li><strong>Tenishia (Тенекиите):</strong> Famous among locals for massive portions of grilled meats and authentic atmosphere.</li>
          <li><strong>Ethno:</strong> Located on the main pedestrian street (Aleksandrovska). A modern take on traditional Bulgarian and Mediterranean.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="glass-panel mb-4" style="border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-cyan);">
        <h3>Need Guaranteed Reservations?</h3>
        <p>If you are traveling with a large group or delegation, walking in to top restaurants during Eurovision week will be impossible. <strong>Fill in your details below, we will contact you and personally arrange your reservation.</strong></p>
        
        <form action="https://api.web3forms.com/submit" method="POST" style="margin-top: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px;">
          <input type="hidden" name="access_key" value="03b548cb-5509-4e30-91a0-785800f9f395" />
          <input type="hidden" name="subject" value="Restaurant Reservation Request" />
          
          <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px;">
            <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Your Name or Delegation" required style="padding: 12px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border); border-radius: 4px; color: #fff;" />
            <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Your Email" required style="padding: 12px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border); border-radius: 4px; color: #fff;" />
          </div>
          
          <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px;">
            <input type="number" name="people" placeholder="Number of People" required style="padding: 12px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border); border-radius: 4px; color: #fff;" />
            <input type="date" name="date" required style="padding: 12px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border); border-radius: 4px; color: #fff;" />
          </div>

          <textarea name="details" rows="3" placeholder="Preferences (e.g., Seafood, Traditional, Sea View...)" style="padding: 12px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border); border-radius: 4px; color: #fff;" required></textarea>
          
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-secondary" style="padding: 14px; font-weight: bold;">Request Reservation</button>
        </form>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-content {
    padding: 64px 24px;
  }
  
  h1 {
    font-size: 2.8rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  
  h2 {
    color: var(--accent-amber);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  
  ul {
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  
  li {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>

